realtek-r8125-optimized-dkms
==========================

Experimental source-only DKMS replacement for r8125. Known package providers
realtek-r8125-dkms and r8125-dkms conflict deliberately; unmanaged module copies
or other DKMS registrations must also be removed through a validated migration.

This package does not blacklist r8169, change routes/offloads/IRQ policy, or
explicitly unload/load NIC drivers. Standard DKMS framework/kernel hooks remain
active and depend on system configuration. Installing may rebuild modules and
change the module selected on the next load/boot. Secure Boot requires a trusted
module signing key, independently of source/PPA archive signatures.

Read PPA-PACKAGING.md and BENCHMARK-AND-ROLLBACK.md before installation. The
package is not a claim of hardware acceptance or a tested recovery route.
